{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10291110","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10291110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1029111001:1":{"text":"실례합니다. 중요하게 여쭙고 싶은 게 하나 있는데, 혹시...","source_cn":"抱歉打扰了，我们有个重要的事情想和你打听一下，你有没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x123AC495B537115D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1029111001":{"text":"실례합니다. 중요하게 여쭙고 싶은 게 하나 있는데, 혹시...","source_cn":"抱歉打扰了，我们有个重要的事情想和你打听一下，你有没有见到过——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x123AC495B537115D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029111002:1":{"text":"엉뚱한 소리를 하는 여자아이요? 그 “엉뚱한 말”이 무얼 뜻하는지요?","source_cn":"胡言乱语的小女孩？”胡言乱语“是指？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BE795AF7F58E370","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029111003:1":{"text":"그냥 뜬금없는 말들 같은 거예요! 악마라느니, 심연이라느니...","source_cn":"就是会说一些很莫名其妙的话！什么恶魔啦，深渊啦之类的东西……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65669B1FD2F8C231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029111004:1":{"text":"여신이시여, 저는 “악마”를 거론하는 여자아이는 보지 못했어요. 만약 봤다면 악마의 손에서 벗어나도록 도와주었을 거예요.","source_cn":"女神在上，我不曾见过说着“恶魔”的女孩。如果见到的话，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD7ED7DF93F1267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fem